## WLED settings for your ESP32-S3

Flash WLED onto your ESP32-S3 using the 
official installer
. Then open its web interface and configure these settings.


LED type: WS281x
LED count: 46
GPIO: 16 (example — verify your board pinout)
Color order: GRB
Maximum brightness: 80 (start low).

## Hyperion.NG setup

Install Hyperion.NG on your Windows PC from the 
official Windows setup guide
.

Enable screen capture for your PC display.

Configure the LED layout to match your physical strip.

Add a WLED device as the LED output.

Enter your ESP32-S3's WLED IP address.

Save the configuration and start the LED output.

